# ===== The Veil, stage 4: Aspect Awakening, 2 - The High Priestess (spec 5, user 2026-10-07) =====
# Internal ids keep "Empress" (D12). Osiris: ARCANA_Aspect_Empress.txt (goal = Doubt applied, Tier II, Which One?, The
# Veil Lifts) and ARCANA_Aspect_Common.txt (goals 4 / 7 / 10). Tier I lives in the DOUBT statuses; Tier II in Osiris;
# Tier III unlocks the reaction card Ready: Which One? (console: UnlockSpell while awakened; PC: conjured to the hand).

